/**
  * @brief  Returns the gain of the ambiant light sensor.
  * @param  Instance ambiant light sensor instance. Could be only 0.
  * @param  Channel ambiant light sensor channel
  * @param  pGain  Pointer to integration time
  * @retval BSP status
  */
